  "unit": "1",
  "sub": "What is a Project and what is Project Management",
  "q": "The traditional project management triangle consists of the following constraints —",
  "opts": {
   "A": "Time, cost and scope",
   "B": "Manager, team and customer",
   "C": "Resource, time and cost",
   "D": "Schedule, quality and profit"
  },
