  "no": 31,
  "paper": "TECH2",
  "unit": "6",
  "sub": "Business Models for implementation of e-Governance",
  "q": "An organization's ability to tailor its products and services for its customers is known as –",
  "opts": {
   "A": "Specialization",
   "B": "Mass customization",
   "C": "Target Commerce",
   "D": "Adaptation"
  },
  "ans": "B",
  "conf": "high",
  "exp": "Mass customization is the standard term for tailoring products or services to individual customers while retaining the economics of mass production. Specialization refers to narrowing what an organisation does, not to per-customer tailoring.",
  "prov": "Derived by a single solver — the bank held no answer for this question and MPSC published no key. Unverified.",
