  "exp": "The standard UNDP/UN-ESCAP attributes of good governance include transparency, responsiveness and accountability (with participation, rule of law, equity, consensus and effectiveness). Democracy is a form of political system, not itself listed as a property of good governance, so 'All of the above' is the trap.",
